| `e2e.list_timeout_s` | number | `30` | a positive number of seconds | `tests/integration/test_e2e_coverage.py`; `tests/live_server.py`; `tests/e2e/conftest.py` | Bounds each child a derivation or a scenario starts (the REST route walk, the exporter and each MCP server); a child past it is killed and named in the failure. | the REST server's readiness: `e2e.server.ready_timeout_s` | always |
